 Is Ahamkar Bad? # First, we need to understand.
The Sanskrit word &amp;ldquo;Ahamkara&amp;rdquo;
is not the same as &amp;ldquo;ego.&amp;rdquo;
Similarly, the Hindi word &amp;ldquo;Ghamand&amp;rdquo;
is not the same as &amp;ldquo;proud.&amp;rdquo;
Those who know Hindi understand,
&amp;ldquo;Ghamand&amp;rdquo; is bad, but pride is good.
Similarly, having Ahamkara is fine.
But having an ego is the problem.
Ahamkara means putting yourself first.
This is not a bad thing.
The problem arises when you think
